        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Almost all of our utility-scale solar projects are self-operated and we provide continuous O&M services (through the in-house O&M service group company) of plant preventive maintenance, round the clock security services, maintenance of switchyard and transmission line, supply of spares and consumables, plant monitoring and logging, insurance and warranty claims, module cleaning, vegetation control, seasonal tilt, photovoltaic module thermography, IV testing of photovoltaic modules, electroluminescence mass testing on a case to case basis, and plant availability warranty.",
        "start_character": 78813,
        "end_character": 79390
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to being one of the largest vertically integrated independent power producers in India, we provide clean energy solutions and value-added energy offerings through digitalization, storage, and carbon market services that increasingly are integral to addressing climate change.",
        "start_character": 1061,
        "end_character": 1348
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are strategically focused on developing a pan-India portfolio of utility-scale wind energy projects, utility-scale solar energy projects, corporate wind energy projects, corporate solar energy projects and utility-scale firm power projects.",
        "start_character": 31437,
        "end_character": 31680
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate our business through a number of subsidiaries and branch offices, which are located in India.",
        "start_character": 198404,
        "end_character": 198508
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are actively engaged in evaluating and structuring commercially viable BESS projects, collaborating with technology providers, EPC contractors, and grid operators to ensure bankability and compliance.",
        "start_character": 86793,
        "end_character": 87010
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Capacity Building: We invest in developing our people through targeted training to enhance their capability to manage ESHS risks and impacts effectively.",
        "start_character": 82680,
        "end_character": 82833
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For asset sale, we typically sell assets at approximately 2x book value.",
        "start_character": 22719,
        "end_character": 22791
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we have developed in-house transmission capabilities, to build transmission lines for upcoming RE projects, and to optimize costs.",
        "start_character": 87633,
        "end_character": 87776
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we also have 6.4 GW of solar module and 2.5 GW of solar cell manufacturing facilities, both of which are operational.",
        "start_character": 816,
        "end_character": 946
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In respect of our wind projects, we manage approximately 1.8 GW of WTGs and another 1.9 GW of BoP in-house, which we believe provides us significant cost and operational benefits.",
        "start_character": 13965,
        "end_character": 14144
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Operation and maintenance: We have developed in-house O&M capabilities with a team of over 900 employees and manage 100% of our solar projects in-house.",
        "start_character": 13812,
        "end_character": 13964
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-325073",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-325073-bb682f2911490f08",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-325073",
        "filing_date": "2026-07-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Recently, we have announced plans to set up a 6.5 GW ingot-wafer manufacturing facility to secure our supply chain following the ALMM-III notification which bans import of wafers from June 1, 2028.",
